 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2017-04-26",
   "text": "Medical Device Safety Act\n This bill amends the Federal Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act to declare that an action for damages or a person's liability under state law is not affected by the federal prohibition on state or local requirements regarding medical devices. This bill is retroactively effective and applies to pending civil actions."
  }
